    editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - guid: 68ad4916-9d58-46ce-8b8b-885c54413bf9
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: A woman passed me by on the street recently.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: 07801e42-cdfc-4029-a6dc-911809621dbd
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: She was holding a steaming hot plate of noodles, reeking of chili. I could have sworn I knew her.
      delaySeconds: 2.6
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: c8b3c50e-71e4-43f7-a741-32642bb3f34f
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I got the urge to run up and give her a hug but, as I was going to say hi, I forgot her name, then her face.
      delaySeconds: 4.5
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 2d6cf0ad-a047-4848-9c88-209f2a03e6db
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: She wasn't who I thought she was, and I don't even know who I thought she was in the first place.
      delaySeconds: 4.9
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: ef6b89a7-fef5-4847-af1b-bbea11f75578
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: This synthetic mind will be the death of me...
      delaySeconds: 4.5
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: ae5bc7cb-3a58-4de7-bfc3-c63ada8d2f44
    kind: 4
    line:
      text: 
      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
